OL,3,GNEWSAUS Office star in the running to
OL,4,Abe new St Andrews Uni rector
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn actor best known for his role as
OL,7,FKevin Malone in the US version of The
OL,8,FOffice is among the candidates to
OL,9,Fbecome the next rector of St Andrews
OL,10,FUniversity.
OL,12,FBrian Baumgartner is among six people
OL,13,Fvying for the role, after he visited St
OL,14,FAndrews in the summer.
OL,16,FIn his address to students, he said he
OL,17,F"fell in love with the town's culture
OL,18,Fand history".
OL,20,FOther candidates include Green MSP Q
OL,21,FManivannan and a ministry of defence
OL,22,Fanalyst.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
